{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-08-20-004", "date": "2026-08-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Samsung Introduces New Over-the-Range Microwave With DualVent Technology", "content": "Samsung Electronics today announced its new Over-the-Range Microwave in the U.S. and Canada beginning September 2026. The new model introduces DualVent technology, a ventilation system with air intakes at both the bottom and front of the microwave. Additional features include Auto Connectivity and a fingerprint resistant finish that helps maintain the microwave’s clean appearance. “Consumers […]", "sources": [{"name": "samsung_elec", "url": "https://news.samsung.com/global/samsung-introduces-new-over-the-range-microwave-with-dualvent-technology", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-20-005", "date": "2026-08-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Researchers develop a new class of deep-blue phosphorescence CF OLED emitters achieving outstanding results", "content": "<p>A team of researchers from Kyoto University, Kyushu University and Tsinghua Shenzhen International Graduate School have designed a new novel class of deep-blue phosphorescence OLED emitters, achieving remarkable performance.</p><div class=\"align-center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2026-08/Deep-blue-CF-oled-emitter-design-Kyoto-Kyushu-Tssinghua.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n    <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/styles/large/pub", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/researchers-develop-new-class-deep-blue-phosphorescence-cf-oled-emitters", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-20-006", "date": "2026-08-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "UDC announces the new OLEDX architecture to improve OLED light output", "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/universal-display\">Universal Display Corporation</a> announced a new OLED architecture, called OLED<sup>X</sup>, that improves how light is extracted and utilized within an OLED device, while offering more control over the light output for display makers. The company says that this architecture, according to its laboratory results, represent one of the most significant advances in OLED energy efficiency since the invention of phosphorescent OLED technology.<", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/udc-announces-new-oledx-architecture-improve-oled-light-output", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-20-007", "date": "2026-08-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["panel_price", "oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.75, "keywords": ["surpass", "growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Omdia sees growth ahead for AR and VR displays, with AR growing at a faster rate", "content": "<p>Omdia releases their latest forecast for the AR and VR markets, saying that by 2030, AR shipments will reach 21 million units, surpassing VR shipments (19 million units). The shift in consumer interest in VR headsets to lightweight AR headsets will continue into 2032 as well, where the market share of AR displays will reach 57% (up from 28% in 2024).</p><div class=\"align-center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2026-08/Omdia-AR-VR-shipments-2024-2032.jpg\" target=\"_", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/omdia-sees-growth-ahead-ar-and-vr-displays-ar-growing-faster-rate", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-20-008", "date": "2026-08-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["panel_price", "it_panel_demand"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.75, "keywords": ["surpass", "expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "China tightens grip on global LCD market as TV panel share tops 70%", "content": "The global LCD panel industry continues to consolidate around Chinese manufacturers, whose share of the LCD TV panel market has remained firmly above 70% and is gradually approaching 80%. Their presence in LCD monitor panels is expanding just as rapidly, having surpassed 70% in the first half of 2026.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20260820PD201/lcd-market-tv-panel-shipments-lcd-panel.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-20-009", "date": "2026-08-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.67, "keywords": ["record", "growth", "increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "AI boom lifts Taiwan tax revenue forecast to record NT$3.52 trillion in 2027", "content": "Taiwan's government expects central tax revenue to reach NT$3.522 trillion in 2027, up 42% from the 2026 budget estimate, driven by continued growth in AI-related manufacturing and investment. The forecast, released by the Ministry of Finance, reflects rising revenue from a stronger industrial base, robust capital spending and increased market activity tied to the island's role in global AI hardware production.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20260820PD224/taiwan-revenue-2027-government-forecast.html", "type": "rss"}]}
